From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:12:55 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] overlay/asteroidos: add companion app bridge and camera
 shutter

Add a generic GATT App Bridge service to asteroid-btsyncd for
bidirectional companion-phone communication:

- app-bridge.patch and appbridgeservice.{h,cpp}: expose a D-Bus
  interface for remote camera and sensor messages.
- camera-shutter.sh: small helper that triggers the companion camera
  shutter through the new bridge.
